nooooo not a NunnerVerse Terms Of Service!!

1. no steal pls
Okay, the NunnerVerse is technically open source, but please don't steal my code and files for profit or even AI. Just because it's not copyrighted doesn't mean you can steal it!!

I'm not making this site for profit myself. So please don't.
You aren't allowed to claim any NunnerLibrary stories that someone else wrote as your own. There is evidence of its existence before yours, anyway.
However, I'm fine if you use any of the images I've uploaded, but only for personal reasons (include credit if you can too). This includes the art galleries. Fan art is of course also allowed. So yes, you can get a tattoo of the NunnerVerse or paint your shoes with the logo.

〜 ❀ 〜

2. i don't steal your stuff
Whenever you use the notepad or Drawing Tool, there is absolutely no record of whatever you inputted stored in some sort of database that I can access. Your data saves locally AKA only on your browser. Heck, there isn't any way for me to use server-sided data ('cause I don't even know how to do allat haha). I could get into the details, but most people would fall asleep if I tried to explain. So technically, you could put sensitive info in the notepad if you really wanted to… (this is still the Internet we're talking about, so maybe don't just be safe).

tldr u no steal my stuff, i no steal ur stuff. everyone is happy yay!

〜 ❀ 〜

3. btw we use cookies
It's mostly only for site data like progress in Web Chef or Refractory. I did set up Google Analytics, but I rarely view it. Every now and then, I check to see how many people visit my site, but that's basically it. Really sorry that it's kinda broken, I think it still collects some data even if you opt-out. Let me know if you have any serious issues with it, and I'll probably take it down.



❀ Sorry if you expected me to yap in an incredulously fancy manner or START SCREAMING AT YOU. I didn't want it to be too serious, but hopefully you'll understand! Thanks for reading.